{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 23:03:37", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-ba3b6b15-ddd7-4f50-849f-1f96a9596da7', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "CONTINUATION OF PREVIOUS TASK\\n\\n## Original Task\\nImplement the requirements documented in: src/field/ensemble_ui/output/tdd_coordinator_model_validation_requirements.md\\n\\nRead the requirements document and implement all specified features.\\nFollow TDD methodology: write tests first, then implementation.\\n\\n## Previous Question\\nThe Development Manager agent could not be found. Can you verify the agent configuration and ensure the \'leadership/development_manager\' agent is properly defined?\\n\\n## User\'s Answer\\ncheck /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/docs/current/AGENT_REGISTRY.md and relaterd files\\n\\n## Instructions\\nThe user has answered your question above. Please continue with implementation based on their clarification. Do not ask the same question again - proceed with the approach based on their answer.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_0185qEPgTcHRmVWAEpx44MXV', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/docs/current/AGENT_REGISTRY.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_0185qEPgTcHRmVWAEpx44MXV', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Agent Registry - Complete List\\n\\n## Overview\\n**Tot