{"timestamp": "2026-01-16 23:04:15", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-f268d05e-4296-4bdd-80bf-0710ebfeda33', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "Implement the requirements documented in: src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_status_m2.md\\n\\nRead the requirements document and implement all specified features.\\nFollow TDD methodology: write tests first, then implementation.",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01MSbxMHg99TbayRtuWf5Y9o', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_status_m2.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01MSbxMHg99TbayRtuWf5Y9o', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Milestone 2 Status: Integration and Testing\\n\\n## Milestone Objectives\\n- Complete comprehensive testing of tracking mechanism\\n- Verify performance and compatibility\\n- Validate error handling and context propagation\\n\\n## Test Coverage\\n- Unit Tests: 95% coverage\\n- Integration Tests: 92% coverage\\n- Performance Tests: Completed\\n- Compatibility Tests: Passed\\n\\n## Performance Metrics\\n- Tracking overhead: 0.8ms (Goal: < 1ms)\\n- Memory usage: 0.6MB (Goal: < 1MB)\\n- Request count tracking: 100% accurate\\n\\n## Compatibility Results\\n- Existing tool interfaces: Fully compatible\\n- No breaking changes detected\\n- Backward compatibility